Marcus,

Rollback is underway but slow. The backfill on billing_transactions
has 12M rows to reverse. Current estimate: ~7 hours
from when we started at 14:30 UTC.

Priya has confirmed the root cause involves a missing lock timeout
guard. The analytics ETL job from the replica was holding a share lock
on billing_transactions that blocked our DDL entirely.

Platform gateway is degraded but operational. payment-service and
billing-service are in read-only mode.

— Jordan

